": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "by 1900 CE, it produced very little and imported textiles from England", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:41:18Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "the Suez Canal played a part in that change", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:41:52Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "This is a picture of the opening of the Suez Canal in 1869 ‎<attached: 00126666-PHOTO-2026-04-25-08-41-52.jpg>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:42:01Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: X=Suez, Y=Canal, Z=textiles", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:42:07Z", "username": "Anurag Bhide", "text": "Painting or photo?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:42:19Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "i think painting", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:42:39Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "very hard to find photos showing Egyptian people because the Suez Company wanted to not include them", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:43:11Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "they tried to give the impression of European machinery and engineering as what hade it possible", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:43:16Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Chinmay: 50, Sal: 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:43:36Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:43:47Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "4.\tX spent his early years striving to become famous. He expounded cocaine as a cure-all, including for morphine addiction. After a visit to a Paris hospital treating “hysteria,” he returned home to Vienna and on April 25, 1886, placed a small newspaper advertisement announcing his hours in private practice at a new office on Rathausstrasse. He then sat and waited. Not a single patient showed up. The young doctor's early years of private practice were financially desperate. He had recently married, was starting a family, and was so strapped for cash that his parents and his fiancée's family had to help pay for the furniture in their apartment. He supplemented his income by translating the works of John Stuart Mill into German. His peculiar method of the “talking cure” eventually became the dominant mode of practice in the 20th century, and his conceptual framework reshaped how Western civilization understood human motivation, literature, art, and sexuality. ID X (10 points). ‎<attached: 00126674-PHOTO-2026-04-25-08-43-47.jpg>", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:43:55Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Freud", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:43:57Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Siggy", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:44:05Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Freud", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:44:13Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Or as i call him sigmund fraud :p", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:44:13Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: X=Sigmund Freud", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:44:31Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "which is a fairly well-deserved name", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:45:01Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "he was caught writing articles using pseudonyms to praise Freud", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:45:14Z", "username": "Anurag Bhide", "text": "Sounds familiar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:45:23Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "There is another person who used to impersonate callers to praise himself ;)", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:45:23Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Chinmay: 50, Sal: 10, Akshay: 10", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-25T15:45:28Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Great minds think alike", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]